    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "idk i'm not sure about 'coincidence' because the timing is just too perfect. i was talking to my brother about my surgery plans last night and the lights literally flickered right when i mentioned the hospital. it's not just a random glitch, it feels way more intentional. like, if they can't use a mic, maybe they're using the power lines or something to sense the vibrations in the air? it's just so creepy. what if they're actually harvesting data without us even knowing?",
